WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:06.000
What should I say at a time like this?

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.490
"You lolicon!" maybe?

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.530
That's about right. I mean, it's not, but...

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:48.890
Hey!

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.330
Saki-san!

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:54.500
Wait, Madarame-san? Isn't Kohsaka-san here?

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.590
Oh, Kohsaka's in a game tournament.

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:01.150
I saw Susie giving this 
guy a kiss downstairs!

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:03.220
He's such a lolicon!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.220
No, no, no.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:06.930
Then will you tell me if 
you get a new phone number?

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.290
Yeah.

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:12.360
She wanted me to go talk 
to Hato and her friends,

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.000
and pranked me when I kept refusing.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.900
Why would Susie care?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.360
I don't know.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.390
I don't know what Sue's thinking,

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:24.660
but Hato-kun left with her old friends.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.580
Oh, what's the--

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.370
Kasukabe-sempai! Hi there.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:32.200
Hey, Oggy. Things going well with Sasahara?

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.350
Yean... thanks.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.930
Ogi-sempai, where's Hato-chan?

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:41.510
Everything got settled. If you want 
the details, ask her, I guess.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:44.020
I guess you're right.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:47.170
Cosplay's really tiring.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:48.940
Yeah. People took lots of pictures.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.880
Hey there.
Hi!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:56.130
Yajima-san and Yoshitake-san, why don't you 
walk around the school with your friends?

00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:58.440
Um...

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:59.880
Go ahead.

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.480
Okay, thanks then!

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:01.890
Want to change?

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.100
And you can cosplay, Saki-san!

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.870
And there it is.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.870
That was a good last episode.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:14.280
Hato-chan! Did things go okay?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.730
Yeah, it's fine.

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:18.780
I'm glad to hear it! You can 
tell me the details later.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:23.180
So you're starting up a 
cosplay business, Tanaka?

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.760
Well, it's not a sure thing yet.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:29.950
But if I'm really going to sell this stuff, 
it'd be a lot easier to do it through a company.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.830
That's true. It has its advantages.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.730
Wow! One of us is going to run a company.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.710
It's not that big a deal!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.240
Are you getting married soon?

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.030
Oh, Saki-san!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.270
What about you, Kugapii?

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:46.120
Still in sales.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.880
No, Kugapii! I'm asking 
if you have a girlfriend.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.800
O-Of course not!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.330
Kasukabe-sempai's here.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:58.410
The whole place seems more lively.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.380
Is this what Genshiken
 was like before last year?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.560
What about Madarame-sempai?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:12.520
He just looked at Kasukabe-sempai!

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.600
Wait, why did I stop?
 It's like I froze up...

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.980
Hato-chin! I'm so sorry.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:25.950
Even if I've got sunglasses on, 
I made a big mistake back there.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:29.850
No, it's fine. I feel better 
now that it's out in the open.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.410
That's the cross-dresser?

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.680
Yes. That's right.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.100
I see.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.770
Yo. If you're here, you should've called.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:39.340
Where's Kohsaka-san?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.310
Why would I call someone
 who asks questions like that?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:45.650
I've given up already!
 At least let me see him.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:46.450
Have you?

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.290
I just want to give him my business card.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.190
Hey!

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:50.610
You guys come by too.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.810
Stop trying to get customers!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.680
Like Watanabe!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.550
I gave him my card a long 
time ago, and he never came by.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:03.530
Oh, Madarame wouldn't 
go to a place like that.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.880
Of course not.

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:08.880
He's too much of a loser to do 
that, and he's a lolicon anyway.

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:09.820
Seriously?

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.720
I heard that, back at Comic Festival,

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.660
Angela went after him hard, 
and he totally shot her down.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.540
Oh? And she's a foreigner?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:20.800
An otaku girl from America,
 with tits almost as big as Ohno's.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:26.680
He's such an idiot. Even if she's not 
really his type, he should've taken her up on it.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.550
It could've changed his outlook on life.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.410
No, no.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.020
Well, he's a total lolicon, 
so of course he didn't.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:34.810
Shut up.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:38.280
I don't think an otaku's ever going 
to get another chance like that.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.810
It doesn't matter.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.640
She doesn't know how sempai feels!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.740
You're not that much of a lolicon, are you?

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.130
Hato-kun, was it? Is it true?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.240
No, well... but...

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:54.760
When I clean up sempai's room,
 I clean up the doujinshi and H-games,

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.160
but well, there <i>is</i> some loli stuff, but...

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.000
Wait a second. Wait a second, Hato-kun.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.270
Madarame, you're making your 
underclassman clean your room?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.280
No, I'm not <i>making</i> her...

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.760
I just doing it because I want to!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:14.250
I need more blood! Bring 
me more! More of anything!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.250
She's binging.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.770
She's totally binging.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.490
You're using his room to
 change into your girl clothes?

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:21.760
When I'm not there!
 I'm at work during the day!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:24.400
No, that's...

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.680
I don't get what you mean. "Cross-dressing"?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:32.500
Yes, cross-dressing. She's really a boy.

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.790
What?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.480
What are you doing?

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:39.690
No way! No way! I can't
 believe that! It's impossible!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.380
Proof! Show me proof!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.160
No way!

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.500
If not your ****, 
then your breasts!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.300
My voice! I'll use my normal voice!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.070
I'm really a guy.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:51.590
No way! I've got goosebumps!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.590
I wish she'd shut up.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:56.240
I see! That's why Watanabe was 
saying it was physically impossible.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:57.860
Yeah.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:01.040
No, no. It doesn't matter if
 someone's a man or a woman, does it?

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.150
Two guys being together is totally okay.

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:07.190
Saki-san, have you gotten into BL?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:10.560
What are you talking about? 
I've got a lot of gay friends.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:12.110
Oh, reality.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.430
Are you people homophobic?

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:18.980
Um... well, I'm straight, is all.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:22.120
I just dress like this as part of 
hanging out with the rotten girls.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.520
Well, it's not like you have 
to change that or anything.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.740
Right...

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:31.550
Wait a second... her, her, and her...

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.060
And her too, I guess.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:33.880
What?

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:38.970
Madarame... is it really your 
turn to be the popular guy?

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:40.890
W-What?

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.920
I'll be a little mean to him, I guess.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:49.900
Come to think of it, when we all went 
to Madarame's room a long time ago,

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:54.740
he was hiding a ton of 
adult S&M DVDs in his desk.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.000
Come to think of it...

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.130
Yeah, he was.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.450
Yeah, he was.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.330
S&M?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.380
Oh, I don't know!

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:07.450
Out of all the H-games and
 H-manga I see when I clean his room,

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:10.620
there's barely any S&M!

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:15.280
I saw a little, but I think he got it at Comic 
Festival because it was about his favorite anime!

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.450
You don't need to go that far.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:21.750
I'm sorry. It just didn't seem 
like you, so I wanted to disagree.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.900
Merely the mistakes of my 
youth. I threw them all out!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:30.100
Then search harder, Hato-kun.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:33.530
Like inside the desk drawers, or the 
closets, or the folders on his PC.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.370
Sure.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:40.130
There's nothing on my PC but hentai you 
wouldn't be ashamed to show anywhere!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.450
You couldn't find a thing--

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.410
--not a thing.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.240
He froze.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.600
He froze. He's hiding them.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.600
I am not! I just stuttered a bit.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.090
Hey.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.800
She just went "Oh!"

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.810
No, I don't know anything...

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.070
This is suspicious! It's really suspicious.

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:04.510
No, seriously... What is it?

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:07.420
Was there anything that bad in my room?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:16.280
Kasukabe-sempai's cosplay pictures.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.660
He's not here. He can't have--

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:29.400
Hey, what did you say?

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:33.470
Watanabe left the minute you said that.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.600
I don't know if I can say.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.100
After all that? And I'm the only one here.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.240
It's Madarame-sempai's private life.

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.580
You're the one who spilled the beans.

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:48.500
Hey, I know!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.340
Does it have something to do with the 
fact that Madarame likes Saki-neesan?

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.980
Am I right?

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:59.580
Does everybody know already?

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.670
I think so.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:04.400
I've talked to Ohno-chan 
and my sister about it.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:07.010
I think most of the old members know it.

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:12.150
But I've never asked
 Saki-neesan about it directly.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.870
Have things changed since 
the new students came?

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:19.630
That's right. They're all rotten 
girls who are really into BL.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.480
Then Madarame doesn't
 really come around anymore?

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:26.020
Yeah. Today's actually the first 
time I've seen him in a while.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:40.320
So I really wasn't the only 
one who knew his secret.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:44.130
Is he really not gay?

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:48.270
He's got this "I understand my sempai 
better than anyone" look on his face.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.150
Girls like that piss me off.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.220
Well, guys like that.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.330
So what exactly did you say?

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:57.250
Um...

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.380
Does she know everything already?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.610
He probably got the pictures from Tanaka-san.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:06.380
If she knows how Madarame-sempai feels 
already, this is probably no different.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.240
Um...

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:10.690
What?! Cosplay pictures of Saki-neesan?

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:11.900
Huh?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.890
No way! That's hilarious!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:21.280
That's awful. That's really awful.

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:24.200
Hey, you.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.050
Yes?

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:29.250
Why don't we make Madarame tell her?

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.460
Tell her?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.400
Saki-neesan hardly ever comes 
to the university, right?

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:38.650
This is the first time since she 
graduated. So this is our chance!

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:40.370
We can force him into it.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:42.170
But what about his feelings?

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:45.220
Find Watanabe. I'll find Saki-neesan...

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:47.040
But maybe Madarame-sempai 
wants things to stay this way!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:50.050
You're the one who
 wrecked any chance of that.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:55.060
It's exhausting to have a secret 
everybody else has already figured out.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.960
Madarame's an idiot, so he can't 
deal with it. That's why he ran.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:03.060
Let's set him free.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:14.110
Sue-chan?

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:19.550
What? Wait!

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:27.950
Is sempai in the club room?

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.890
Wait a second. I'll...

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.500
Hello?

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:40.490
Um, about the pictures... well...

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:44.570
It was really pure chance 
that I found them. I'm sorry.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.870
And so, if you're in the club room...

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:50.830
Can you wait there?

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.620
<b>Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture</b>

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:57.000
I'm sure you'll understand 
as soon as you go inside.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:05.220
I don't know what'll happen.  
That's up to Madarame.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.850
Huh? What's up Saki-chan?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.220
What's going on?

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:20.560
Bwa?

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:23.300
Let's go, Sasahara-kun.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.940
Yeah...

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:25.950
Me too--

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.950
You stay here, Madarame-san.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.000
Saki-chan, I'll explain why 
I'm dressed like this later.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:34.020
For now, I'll say I won the tournament.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.340
Congrats.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.100
Now then...

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.690
It's been a while, I guess.

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:54.830
I heard you haven't been 
coming around much lately.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.270
Yeah...

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.290
Don't be so stiff.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:06.770
Actually, I'm not sure what's going on.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:10.370
Hato-kun told me to stay here.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.710
Well, basically...

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.790
They've locked the two of us in here.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.210
Saki-san's gone too.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.060
You're right.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:26.110
I know! Do you think something Saki x Mada

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.470
is beginning on the other side of the world?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.340
Huh?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:32.390
Saki-chan is alone in the 
club room with Madarame.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.700
Kohsaka-san!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:34.470
Hey there!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.270
Does that mean...

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.830
Is that your cosplay from the trap game?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.210
That's not important right now.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:44.240
I've only seen it in pictures!

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.740
The two of them are alone together?

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.000
Why are you here, Sasahara-san?

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.430
Sorry. He sent me the outfit.

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:56.830
I wanted to surprise everyone, so I had 
him bring it to the club room in secret.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.910
Well, as long as you came.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:02.380
And so what's this? Just the two of them?

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:06.090
Keiko-chan and Hato-kun set it up.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.050
What? That sounds like something 
out of Sweet Azure Flowers.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.530
Huh? But are you okay with this, Kohsaka-kun?

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:16.600
I care about Madarame-san too.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:20.920
So I'm willing to do this for him.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:25.650
Was I that obvious?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.280
About what?

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.650
About what?

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:34.280
You know... the reason they put us in here...

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.480
What are you talking about?

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:40.990
This is harsh. You're an 
iron wall, Kasukabe-san.

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.890
What are you talking about?

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:45.530
No, no. Seriously, you're merciless.

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:49.470
Look, stop trying to 
dance around the subject

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:53.160
by using insults to get under my skin.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:58.900
Does she really... not know?

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:02.790
Don't just sit there. Say something.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:08.450
Jeez, fine. Let's talk about old times then.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:12.200
It was at the school festival, 
when I was a freshman.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:16.030
When you put those cat ears on me, 
that was when I first realized

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.870
"Oh hey, he likes me."

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:25.120
I was trying so hard not to 
be the one to bring it up.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.960
You really are a loser, Madarame.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.440
Does that...

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:33.700
No way... that long ago?

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:36.200
It's too early! That was years ago!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:38.130
You didn't realize you liked me?

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.850
Realize... realize...

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:49.690
That was the first day I 
realized that I liked her.

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.900
And I was certain...

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.010
...then.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:01.640
I can't say that!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:06.910
If I say that, that means 
telling her that I like her!

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.050
And anyway,

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:15.880
what's the point in telling someone how you 
feel, if you know you'll be shot down?

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:22.010
You got quiet again.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:31.000
What do I want to do? Alone 
in a room with Kasukabe-san...

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.520
What do I want to say?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:43.540
Back then... you had a 
nose hair sticking out.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.910
Huh? Nose hair?

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:50.930
But the moment I tried to tell you...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.320
You punched me.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.100
B-Back then?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:18:00.060
But didn't you say you'd forgotten 
about that? Just before we graduated.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.930
I wasn't brave enough to say it.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.310
What? Not brave enough?

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:10.060
It was easier to pretend like 
I'd forgotten all about it.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:16.580
Back when you graduated, 
that's the kind of guy I was.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:22.120
But today, they gave this to me...

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.090
And you brought it up.

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:30.290
So... I'll say it! I'll 
say it loud and clear!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:34.200
Back then, you had a nose hair sticking out!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.770
Is that...

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:45.010
...really a line you want to 
say with tears in your eyes?

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.500
Damn it!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.020
That's horrible.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:56.150
Screaming, "You had a 
nose hair sticking out."

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.800
But... that's all right.

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:11.400
I'm sorry. I've got Kohsaka, 
so I can't be with you.

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:17.630
T-That's not what I m-meant...

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:25.320
No.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.910
I see...

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:35.850
By the way... I was just wondering.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:40.450
From the way you said it... 
if Kohsaka wasn't around?

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:44.360
Maybe we could've had a future together.

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.060
Thank you.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.170
It's over.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.080
I feel so relieved.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.010
What's wrong?

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:20.080
It's just... somehow, getting turned 
down made me feel a lot better.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.830
I'm surprised how much.

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:30.460
Oh, no!

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:35.960
Why are you crying, Kasukabe-san?

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:42.600
Like I said... it's been 
four years for me too.

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:48.140
I'd swore I wouldn't act like I already knew.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:55.020
But that just made me feel like 
I was hurting you, so...

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.480
I feel so relieved.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.700
That's not true.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:08.900
And now I know...

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:12.800
...that Kasukabe-san cries easily.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:17.490
It really was fun.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:22.430
It really was...

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.910
...fun.

00:23:10.090 --> 00:23:13.350
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:12.500
We don't get a lot of screen time, do we?

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:15.490
So let's get our lines in while we can.
 Kugayama, you drawing much lately?

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:19.620
I'm drawing Zekashima stuff, but I'm not sure 
exactly who because I can't register at the site. {Oh dear me this is obscure.  This is a reference to a net game called Kantai Collection, which is insanely popular but nobody can register for it because their servers can't keep up with the popularity.}

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:22.350
Sue would be great as one of those ships. 
Aren't the servers stable now? {Yes they're anthropomorphic ships.  Ww2 Battleships actually.}

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:23.250
I've been so busy...

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:24.710
Right, you've got a job now.

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:27.210
Madarame's having all the fun.
 He's practically the star of the show!

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:28.340
Or maybe the heroine?

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:29.440
Well, he got dumped.

00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:32.760
Tanaka, Sasahara, and Kohsaka all have 
girlfriends! What am I supposed to do?

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.260
It's the same with screentime.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:36.580
Looks like Tanaka-sempai's gets a 
lot of screen time next episode.

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:37.920
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second Generation</i>

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:40.100
Love and Work and Cheesecake!  {Love and Elections and Chocolate, wasn't it?  An old anime/visual novel.}
